  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{妨|さまた}げる: to hinder/obstruct (something)\n- 〜が〜を{妨|さまた}げる: (something) hinders (something else)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {成長|せいちょう}を{妨|さまた}げる: to hinder growth\n- {発展|はってん}を{妨|さまた}げる: to impede development\n- {睡眠|すいみん}を{妨|さまた}げる: to disturb sleep\n- {進行|しんこう}を{妨|さまた}げる: to obstruct progress\n- {自由|じゆう}を{妨|さまた}げる: to impede freedom\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{妨|さまた}げる vs {邪魔|じゃま}する: Both mean to get in the way. {邪魔|じゃま}する is more colloquial and often used for minor interference in everyday situations. {妨|さまた}げる is more formal and implies more serious or systematic obstruction.\n\nThe noun form is {妨|さまた}げ (hindrance, obstacle).",
